# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/
README.html
Cargo.lock
build.out

# Telemetry log segment files written by tcslog
telemetry/

# Resume command written by the SessionEnd hook
claude-resume

# What tcsgui keeps beside a configuration it is editing: the history that
# makes undo survive a crash. Of a moment rather than of a configuration, so
# it is not something to commit.
# The editor's undo history, which used to live beside the configuration and
# is now in the user's own state directory: $XDG_STATE_HOME/tcsgui. Kept here
# for a while so that a checkout with an old one in it stays clean.
*.tcsgui-history
